{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The Reunion", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "New Paths", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 18, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe plans for the organization of events.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Past Time Expressions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are many ways to refer to specific times in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">three years ago </span> or <span class=\"italic\">last year</span> when you talk about the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">in 2012</span> when you talk about a year in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">When I was \u2026 </span> to talk about a period of time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Expression \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" in \u2026 (month or year)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I went to Mexico in 2012.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" last \u2026 (day, month, time, etc.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I visited my Aunt Nelly last year.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" (number of months or years) \u2026  ago\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I bought my ticket 3 weeks ago.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When I was ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I played in a basketball tournament when I was in high school.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I remember visiting San Francisco about 10 years ago. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When I was in high school, I used to travel a lot.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past Tense and Past Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished.   You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or an action that     was happening at a time in the past.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.<br>   Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">-ied</span>.  <br> Irregular verbs change in different ways. <br>  For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary did followed by the    verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask \u2026 </span>? <br><span class=\"italic\"> Did </span>is the past form of <span class=\"italic\">to do</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For Past Continuous, we add was/were + verb\u201cing\u201d to verbs.   <br>Some verbs need a change to the last letter to add \u201cing\u201d.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"do \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"did \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were doing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"carry \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"carried \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were carrying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" pay  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"paid\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were paying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" travel  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"traveled\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were traveling\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rip \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" ripped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were ripping\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"   was/were having\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I did so much shopping when I was traveling in Europe.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " They were talking when he ripped his jacket.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "interior designer ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who helps you decorate a room", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I might get an interior designer to help me decorate this room.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are the words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "chest", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large box used for storing things or clothes ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This chest is amazing!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "nesting dolls", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of dolls that fit inside each other ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Those are nesting dolls I got in Russia.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "eclectic ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " diverse; from many places, cultures ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: San Francisco is a really eclectic city.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "open-minded", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describing someone who is open to new ideas and people ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The people in San Francisco are open-minded.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "benefit ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a form of additional payment at work (vacation time, pension, health care)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: We have great benefits at work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "You're too much ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " Say this when you want to tell someone they are funny ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Oh, Sally. You're too much.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Read the role cards below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose one role.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the modals <span class=\"italic\">will</span>, <span class=\"italic\">may</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to talk about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Be creative and have fun with your partner!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1</span>: You are at a festival and you see a tent with a sign that reads \u201cPsychic Readings\u201d. You are interested and enter the tent. Find out what the future holds for you.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2</span>: You are a psychic (you have special powers to see the future). A person enters your tent and wants to know what their future holds. Tell them an interesting story.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I act out a situation between a psychic and a customer. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I switch roles with my partner and practice again.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le18ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le18ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I can't believe John's news!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah. If he has the wedding here, I'll help plan it. I love planning events.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You should be an interior designer. You can write a blog about it, too!", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I might continue blogging about travel.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You can blog about the cool things you got last month - like this chest or those nesting dolls. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sounds like you found your dream job, Sally.", "time": "12000"}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Speaking of dream jobs ... what do you want to do at the PR firm, Peter?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm not sure yet. I heard they have great benefits. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, if you get the job, I'll come and visit you in Boston.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I will, too! While I was doing some research about travel destinations last year, I read that Bostonians are really open-minded people. The city has an eclectic mix of shops and restaurants. Perfect for you and me, V!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Ok, so let's all move to Boston.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, Vanessa, you're too much.", "time": "23000"}], "coverimg": "engenn5le18ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le18ob11re6aud01", "images": [], "coverimg": "engenn5le18ob11re6img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 3, "contents": [{"value": "engenn5le18ob11re6aud02", "type": "audio"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "text", "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can use expressions to indicate the past.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can say what I'm doing in the future and talk about possible actions and events in the future. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can report about the past and say what I was doing when something else happened. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What have you planned for the future?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "When are you planning on doing it?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", 